   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Principle 1\nPure planning, impure emitting.\nThe plan has no side effects, so dry-run and\nreal run share the SAME code path up to the\nemit step. Selection logic must never differ.",
   "originalText": "Principle 1\nPure planning, impure emitting.\nThe plan has no side effects, so dry-run and\nreal run share the SAME code path up to the\nemit step. Selection logic must never differ.",
