   "text": "DLQ replay plan (DRY RUN - nothing was written)\n\ncluster:      kafka-prod-1  (confirm: matches --env prod)\nsource topic: events.dlq\ntarget topic: events.raw    (original-topic mode)\nfilters:      class=PERMANENT_DB code=23503\n              failed-after=2026-11-22T08:00Z\nmatched:      1,842 records (duplicates collapsed: 37)\neligible:     1,805\nskipped:      0 missing-dedup, 12 over-replay-cap,\n              25 too-old (>7 d)\nby class:     PERMANENT_DB/23503: 1,805\nby tenant:    acme 1,204 | globex 311 | initech 290\nevent age:    min 2m, median 41m, max 3h 12m\nrate:         200 msg/s -> estimated 9 s (--rate)\nheaders:      replay.run_id, replay.count=1, replay.at,\n              replay.original_dedup_key, replay.reason\nsample (3):   key=acme event_id=... offset=5:2893 ...\nplan hash:    9c1f...  (pass --plan-hash 9c1f... with --execute)",
