   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "EVENT TIME vs PROCESSING TIME: keep the original event time in the payload; the sink must not stamp \"now\" over it.\nReplayed events show high freshness lag. That is TRUE, and they should be excluded from SLO dashboards (tag them via the replay.* header).",
   "originalText": "EVENT TIME vs PROCESSING TIME: keep the original event time in the payload; the sink must not stamp \"now\" over it.\nReplayed events show high freshness lag. That is TRUE, and they should be excluded from SLO dashboards (tag them via the replay.* header).",
