   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Together (S3-F5, S3-F6) + delivery-semantics series, EventPulse can state its guarantee:\nat-least-once delivery, an exactly-once EFFECT at the sink, no silent loss of any accepted message,\nand a reversible, auditable path for those that cannot be processed.",
